/S /H3
/T (This strategy is built around the idea that price often returns to the 50% level of a previous price range before continuing in the direction of the broader trend. The model focuses on moments when price manipulates a key high or low, then quickly reverses back into the range, offering a high-probability entry with clearly defined risk.)
